### Kevalon ERP — Module 15: CA Panel Endpoints
### Base URL: http://localhost:5000/api
### Use VS Code REST Client extension to run these requests

@baseUrl = http://localhost:5000/api
@token = REPLACE_WITH_ACCESS_TOKEN
@companyId = REPLACE_WITH_COMPANY_ID
@financialYearId = REPLACE_WITH_FINANCIAL_YEAR_ID
@mismatchedFinancialYearId = REPLACE_WITH_MISMATCHED_FINANCIAL_YEAR_ID

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# 1. CA DASHBOARD ENDPOINT
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

### 1.1 Get CA Panel Dashboard (Successful view)
GET {{baseUrl}}/ca-panel/dashboard?companyId={{companyId}}&financialYearId={{financialYearId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 1.2 Get Dashboard with Mismatched Financial Year (expect 400 Bad Request)
GET {{baseUrl}}/ca-panel/dashboard?companyId={{companyId}}&financialYearId={{mismatchedFinancialYearId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 1.3 Get Dashboard without Financial Year (succeeds, returns null financialYear shape)
GET {{baseUrl}}/ca-panel/dashboard?companyId={{companyId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# 2. CONSOLIDATED AUDIT REPORT ENDPOINT
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

### 2.1 Get Consolidated Audit Report (Without date range filter)
GET {{baseUrl}}/ca-panel/audit-report?companyId={{companyId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 2.2 Get Consolidated Audit Report (With date range filter)
GET {{baseUrl}}/ca-panel/audit-report?companyId={{companyId}}&from=2025-04-01&to=2026-03-31
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# 3. INCOME TAX SUMMARY ENDPOINT
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

### 3.1 Get Income Tax Computation Summary (Successful view)
GET {{baseUrl}}/ca-panel/income-tax-summary?companyId={{companyId}}&financialYearId={{financialYearId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 3.2 Get Income Tax Summary Missing financialYearId (expect 400 Bad Request)
GET {{baseUrl}}/ca-panel/income-tax-summary?companyId={{companyId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 3.3 Get Income Tax Summary with non-existent financialYearId (expect 404 Not Found)
GET {{baseUrl}}/ca-panel/income-tax-summary?companyId={{companyId}}&financialYearId=600000000000000000000000
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
